WEBVTT

00:00:00.052 --> 00:00:03.057
This example website uses a fictional profile and posts.

00:00:03.341 --> 00:00:06.145
Text posts, photos, and articles appear in one feed.

00:00:06.235 --> 00:00:08.836
Open an article to read the full post.

00:00:14.375 --> 00:00:15.377
Create a text post in the admin page.

00:00:15.445 --> 00:00:17.447
Click Publish to save the post at its own URL.

00:00:17.483 --> 00:00:20.485
The new post appears at the top of the feed.
